##

00:00:00.677 --> 00:00:02.677 line:91%
<i>This video is sponsored by
Wondrium.</i>

00:00:02.677 --> 00:00:04.443 line:91%
<i>More on that
at the end of the show.</i>

00:00:04.443 --> 00:00:06.419 line:85%
<c.yellow><i>Previously on Tom Scott plus...</i></c>

00:00:06.419 --> 00:00:08.946 line:91%
I thought I'd got through without
having cold water in my wellies!

00:00:09.446 --> 00:00:12.231 line:91%
Oh no, that's— that's wet socks.
Okay, lovely.

00:00:12.231 --> 00:00:14.230 line:85%
Oh, that's incredibly unpleasant!

00:00:14.230 --> 00:00:15.948 line:85%
Hooh, that's cold! Okay, cool.

00:00:16.836 --> 00:00:18.001 line:85%
<i>(groans)</i>

00:00:18.001 --> 00:00:19.995 line:91%
How am I getting
cold water shock off that?

00:00:19.995 --> 00:00:22.417 line:91%
That's genuinely—
I need to properly sit down.

00:00:22.917 --> 00:00:24.290 line:85%
That got real very quickly!

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:28.565 line:91%
What happened there was just
sudden body nausea...

00:00:28.565 --> 00:00:31.721 line:91%
and almost like my brain
started to shut down.

00:00:31.721 --> 00:00:33.763 line:85%
It was like, "Stop this now."

00:00:33.763 --> 00:00:38.222 line:91%
Oh, I hate saying these words.
I can't physically do that!

00:00:38.222 --> 00:00:40.834 line:91%
You should take
the camera team onwards.

00:00:40.834 --> 00:00:42.001 line:85%
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>

00:00:42.001 --> 00:00:43.538 line:85%
I'll wait around with the crew.

00:00:43.538 --> 00:00:46.455 line:91%
I am gonna be grumpy about this
for a long while.

00:00:51.416 --> 00:00:53.039 line:85%
So, I'm back.

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:55.638 align:start size:97% position:3% line:8%
<c.cyan>I never really thought that
you would come back.</c>

00:00:55.638 --> 00:00:59.156 align:start position:0% line:8%
<c.cyan>But I'm really happy that you decided
to take on this challenge again.</c>

00:00:59.156 --> 00:01:01.061 line:85%
It feels like unfinished business.

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:04.825 line:91%
<c.cyan>And I have every— I just know that
you're gonna do this, this time.</c>

00:01:04.825 --> 00:01:06.295 line:85%
I'm glad you do, 'cause—

00:01:06.295 --> 00:01:09.869 position:64% line:91%
I could've spent the last months doing
cold water training and building that up,

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:12.065 line:91%
but what I've actually done is
relied on technology.

00:01:12.065 --> 00:01:18.293 line:91%
I have a full layer of 3mm neoprene
socks, wetsuit, gloves.

00:01:18.293 --> 00:01:21.361 position:56% line:85%
So... I'm very, very warm right now.

00:01:21.361 --> 00:01:24.194 line:91%
And hopefully that's
gonna work down there.

00:01:24.194 --> 00:01:28.422 position:56% line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah, I know it will, because
you've become so prepared this time,</c>

00:01:28.422 --> 00:01:30.671 position:58% line:85%
<c.cyan>that it's just gonna work out, and...</c>

00:01:30.671 --> 00:01:34.499 position:67% line:91%
I hope it's not undiagnosed claustrophobia.
That would be bad... but...

00:01:34.499 --> 00:01:37.468 position:59% line:91%
<c.cyan>Well, we'll find out today,
and it'll be a journey for both of us.</c>

00:01:37.468 --> 00:01:39.265 line:91%
<c.cyan>And you'll get through it.
I just know you will.</c>

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:42.101 position:72% line:68%
I wasn't nervous until about five minutes ago,
when we came back here.

00:01:42.352 --> 00:01:45.914 line:91%
Just to be clear, we have
the same safety team as last time.

00:01:45.914 --> 00:01:47.849 line:91%
We have mostly the same crew
helping us round.

00:01:47.849 --> 00:01:49.496 line:85%
<c.cyan>Are you ready?</c>

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:52.608 line:91%
I will never not be
more ready than this...

00:01:52.608 --> 00:01:55.924 line:91%
is the cautiously phrased,
guarded answer to that.

00:01:55.924 --> 00:01:58.372 position:61% line:91%
<c.cyan>Alright, so if you'd like to follow me.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Yeah. Let's do it.</c>

00:01:58.372 --> 00:02:00.753 line:91%
Down the slide.
<c.cyan>Alright, I'll get down the slide.</c>

00:02:00.753 --> 00:02:02.829 position:56% line:91%
<c.cyan>You don't have to go down the slide.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Ah, I will, I will.</c>

00:02:02.829 --> 00:02:04.916 line:85%
It's— It's just— It's not—

00:02:04.916 --> 00:02:07.464 line:91%
It's not a good slide.
<c.cyan>It's not a good slide.</c>

00:02:07.464 --> 00:02:09.731 position:58% line:91%
The BBC did not pay for a good slide.
<c.cyan>No.</c>

00:02:18.444 --> 00:02:20.855 line:91%
Is it me, or is it muddier
down here than last time?

00:02:20.855 --> 00:02:24.203 line:91%
<c.cyan>It's very much muddier.
Do you happen to like mud?</c>

00:02:24.203 --> 00:02:27.762 position:58% line:91%
I've got 3mm of neoprene
I'm indifferent to mud at the minute.

00:02:27.762 --> 00:02:29.428 line:91%
<c.cyan>That's brilliant.
That's a good sign.</c>

00:02:29.428 --> 00:02:31.150 line:91%
Agh!
<c.cyan>You okay?</c>

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:32.539 line:85%
I'm fine, just...

00:02:32.539 --> 00:02:34.378 line:91%
This boot actually stuck
in the mud there.

00:02:34.378 --> 00:02:35.822 line:91%
That's great, that's lovely.
<c.cyan><i>(laughs)</i></c>

00:02:35.822 --> 00:02:37.317 line:85%
<c.cyan>That's a normal thing, I promise.</c>

00:02:37.317 --> 00:02:39.241 line:85%
I'll tell you what, Elise.

00:02:39.667 --> 00:02:42.458 line:91%
Last time...
Last time we were here,

00:02:42.458 --> 00:02:45.124 line:91%
obviously, wet cave,
lot of cold water.

00:02:45.124 --> 00:02:48.000 line:85%
I got a load of emails...

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:50.518 line:91%
...from American cavers,
who were like,

00:02:50.518 --> 00:02:53.534 line:91%
"I can't believe they took you down
into a wet cave. That's so unsafe."

00:02:53.534 --> 00:02:55.956 position:61% line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>But this just seems normal for Britain?</c>

00:02:55.956 --> 00:03:00.001 position:56% line:91%
<c.cyan>So this is, in my opinion,
one of the safest caves in the UK...</c>

00:03:00.001 --> 00:03:02.583 line:85%
<c.cyan>...because it's so well explored...</c>

00:03:02.583 --> 00:03:05.715 line:91%
<c.cyan>...but you've also got so many
flood warnings before it floods,</c>

00:03:05.715 --> 00:03:09.597 line:91%
<c.cyan>and water is all around Derbyshire,
which is where we are.</c>

00:03:09.597 --> 00:03:13.387 position:56% line:91%
<c.cyan>So, in actual fact, this is probably
one of the safest caves</c>

00:03:13.387 --> 00:03:16.249 line:85%
<c.cyan>in the area that we could go to.</c>

00:03:16.249 --> 00:03:19.972 position:66% line:91%
The Americans just seem really freaked out
about the idea of a wet cave in general?

00:03:19.972 --> 00:03:25.092 position:64% line:91%
<c.cyan>Well Americans, they don't have wet caves
like us British people, unfortunately.</c>

00:03:25.092 --> 00:03:27.475 position:58% line:85%
<c.cyan>So here, we've got Buxton Water Sump.</c>

00:03:27.475 --> 00:03:30.347 position:58% line:91%
Yep. Now this is where we cleaned off
last time, I remember this.

00:03:30.347 --> 00:03:34.277 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah, so a lot of cavers
use this sump to their own benefit,</c>

00:03:34.277 --> 00:03:37.055 line:91%
<c.cyan>by cleaning their clothes
after they got muddy.</c>

00:03:37.055 --> 00:03:39.679 line:91%
When was this built?
'Cause this is clearly built.

00:03:39.679 --> 00:03:41.298 line:91%
<c.cyan>Well, I'm not sure when
this was built.</c>

00:03:41.298 --> 00:03:44.566 position:77% line:91%
<c.cyan>In fact, our team might have a lot more knowledge
on when this in particular was built,</c>

00:03:44.566 --> 00:03:47.730 line:91%
<c.cyan>But the sump itself, the water,
has always been here.</c>

00:03:47.730 --> 00:03:49.976 line:91%
Right, and someone just put
a dam up to make it—

00:03:49.976 --> 00:03:52.887 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah, yeah. So that we can use it
to our own advantage.</c>

00:03:52.887 --> 00:03:54.929 line:91%
So last time,
I started to freak out

00:03:54.929 --> 00:03:57.310 line:91%
when I got water in
at the Mucky Ducks down there.

00:03:57.310 --> 00:03:59.348 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah, when the water came
into your boots.</c>

00:03:59.348 --> 00:04:03.107 line:91%
Yeah, so I'm gonna
do that here this time,

00:04:03.107 --> 00:04:05.683 line:91%
and test the new gear,
and make sure that I—

00:04:05.683 --> 00:04:09.008 line:91%
If I freak out here, that's fine.
We're in loads of space.

00:04:09.008 --> 00:04:10.834 line:85%
If I freak out there...

00:04:10.834 --> 00:04:12.947 line:85%
So cool. All I need to do...

00:04:12.947 --> 00:04:15.950 position:58% line:85%
...is exactly what I've been doing...

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:19.262 line:91%
...like training at home here,
which is...

00:04:22.333 --> 00:04:24.001 line:85%
...wade into the water.

00:04:25.525 --> 00:04:26.714 line:85%
And, uh...

00:04:28.133 --> 00:04:29.422 line:85%
...sit down.

00:04:30.319 --> 00:04:33.695 position:58% line:91%
I can literally feel the water
just steadily rising inside the suit.

00:04:33.695 --> 00:04:37.044 line:91%
So this is a lot more gentle.
I think I'm gonna be okay here.

00:04:37.044 --> 00:04:41.079 line:91%
But, that's what I said last time.
So let's just— Alright.

00:04:41.631 --> 00:04:43.875 line:91%
I felt the air bubbles escaping.
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>

00:04:43.875 --> 00:04:46.564 line:91%
There's the cold water, okay.
<c.cyan>Okay, how do you feel?</c>

00:04:46.564 --> 00:04:48.891 line:91%
I'm fine. Breathe through it.
I've practiced this.

00:04:48.891 --> 00:04:53.176 line:91%
I've been sitting in an ice bath,
in this wetsuit, at home.

00:04:53.176 --> 00:04:54.336 line:85%
<c.cyan>Oh my god.</c>

00:04:55.605 --> 00:04:56.612 line:85%
Okay!

00:04:56.612 --> 00:04:58.835 line:91%
<c.cyan>It won't get any worse
than this temperature.</c>

00:04:58.835 --> 00:04:59.668 line:85%
Yeah.

00:05:00.168 --> 00:05:02.015 line:85%
So, I mean, the good thing is...

00:05:02.551 --> 00:05:04.740 line:91%
Neoprene socks are working.
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:07.540 line:85%
Stomach's a bit cold, but...

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:09.051 line:91%
...that's okay.
<c.cyan>Brilliant.</c>

00:05:09.051 --> 00:05:12.136 line:91%
Let me just move about a bit,
redistribute the cold water.

00:05:13.038 --> 00:05:15.605 line:85%
It's not pleasant, but...

00:05:15.605 --> 00:05:17.816 line:91%
<c.cyan>Look at you!</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Agh, straight down my back!</c>

00:05:17.816 --> 00:05:19.504 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(both laughing)</i></c>

00:05:19.504 --> 00:05:21.320 line:85%
Yeah, okay. I can live with this.

00:05:21.862 --> 00:05:23.816 line:91%
<c.cyan>Are you feeling confident
to go through?</c>

00:05:24.666 --> 00:05:26.779 line:91%
More than I was.
I think I'll...

00:05:28.441 --> 00:05:30.974 line:91%
Now I know I'm okay
from cold water shock.

00:05:31.382 --> 00:05:33.344 line:91%
I just need to know that
it wasn't claustrophobia,

00:05:33.344 --> 00:05:36.115 line:91%
and the only way to find
that out is... through there.

00:05:36.115 --> 00:05:38.749 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah. We'll be with you
every step of the way.</c>

00:05:38.749 --> 00:05:40.500 line:85%
Let's do it. Let's do it.

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:43.102 line:85%
Ah, right down my back! <i>(groans)</i>

00:05:43.602 --> 00:05:45.266 line:85%
<i>(grunts, chuckles)</i>

00:05:45.266 --> 00:05:49.490 position:56% line:91%
I am now carrying an extra half-kilo
in each shoe, with every step.

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:52.789 position:61% line:91%
<c.cyan>So the water will soak up,
but it'll get to your body temperature.</c>

00:05:52.789 --> 00:05:55.392 line:91%
<c.cyan>And now we are approaching
the part last time...</c>

00:05:55.392 --> 00:05:58.030 line:91%
Oh, this is the bit.
<c.cyan>This is the Mucky Ducks, basically.</c>

00:05:58.030 --> 00:06:00.347 line:91%
<c.cyan>This is where you had
a bit of trouble last time.</c>

00:06:00.347 --> 00:06:03.143 line:91%
A bit of trouble(!)
<c.cyan>This time it won't happen.</c>

00:06:03.143 --> 00:06:06.351 line:91%
<c.cyan>I promise you, it will—
You'll be fantastic.</c>

00:06:08.974 --> 00:06:09.992 line:85%
I'm...

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:14.491 position:58% line:91%
I'm nervous, 'cause this is the point
where things went wrong last time.

00:06:14.491 --> 00:06:16.168 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>But I'm...</c>

00:06:17.088 --> 00:06:19.096 line:85%
I'm not— The heart rate's not—

00:06:19.096 --> 00:06:21.424 line:91%
But it wasn't last time.
I was absolutely fine,

00:06:21.424 --> 00:06:24.414 position:56% line:91%
until halfway through it,
at which point something went wrong.

00:06:24.414 --> 00:06:26.132 line:91%
And I think it was
just cold water shock.

00:06:26.132 --> 00:06:28.053 line:85%
<i>(breathing heavily)</i>

00:06:31.188 --> 00:06:32.554 line:85%
<c.green>That's it, just catch your breath.</c>

00:06:32.554 --> 00:06:33.880 line:91%
Yeah. I...
<c.yellow>Yeah.</c>

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:35.254 line:85%
<i>(breathing heavily)</i>

00:06:35.754 --> 00:06:39.490 position:64% line:91%
<c.cyan>Okay, so just be aware, there are
lots of rocks you can't see in the water.</c>

00:06:39.490 --> 00:06:41.402 line:91%
Yep.
<c.cyan>Which is why I go slowly.</c>

00:06:41.402 --> 00:06:44.622 line:91%
This is fine.
I can put my hand underwater,

00:06:44.622 --> 00:06:47.425 line:91%
and it's not... the freakout
it was last time,

00:06:47.425 --> 00:06:49.529 line:91%
'cause it doesn't feel cold.
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>

00:06:49.529 --> 00:06:52.350 line:91%
This is fine, this is fine,
this is fine.

00:06:52.350 --> 00:06:54.458 line:85%
This is also the shallow bit.

00:06:55.187 --> 00:06:58.572 line:91%
<c.cyan>Where are we going?</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Oh there's that rock! <i>(laughs)</i></c>

00:06:58.572 --> 00:07:02.357 line:91%
Every time, that rock just there!
<c.cyan>Yes! Yeah.</c>

00:07:02.357 --> 00:07:04.638 line:91%
<c.cyan>So annoying.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Right.</c>

00:07:04.638 --> 00:07:07.721 position:67% line:91%
I mean, I was already having a panic attack
last time at this point, so...

00:07:07.721 --> 00:07:09.602 line:91%
<c.cyan>This is where you sat down.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Yes.</c>

00:07:10.169 --> 00:07:13.807 line:91%
This is the point where I was
sat down here, having a breather.

00:07:13.807 --> 00:07:16.601 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah!</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>And I don't need one, so...</c>

00:07:16.601 --> 00:07:18.522 line:91%
This is good.
<c.cyan>This is brilliant.</c>

00:07:18.522 --> 00:07:20.767 line:91%
Let's keep going, let's keep going.
<c.cyan>I'm loving this.</c>

00:07:21.339 --> 00:07:24.202 line:91%
The water doesn't feel as high
as last time either?

00:07:24.202 --> 00:07:27.507 line:91%
<c.cyan>No it doesn't. I think we've had
a bit of a dry spell recently.</c>

00:07:28.177 --> 00:07:30.996 position:63% line:85%
<c.cyan>Which is fantastic. Lots of silt though.</c>

00:07:30.996 --> 00:07:34.227 position:61% line:91%
Yeah, I'm just kinda going on
hands and knees through here, I'm fine.

00:07:34.227 --> 00:07:35.345 line:85%
<c.cyan>Brilliant.</c>

00:07:35.345 --> 00:07:38.071 line:91%
Whoa okay, yeah,
but there was no handhold there.

00:07:38.071 --> 00:07:39.534 line:91%
I think maybe
you got the right idea.

00:07:40.034 --> 00:07:44.427 line:91%
I can't believe I got through this
last time with the...

00:07:44.427 --> 00:07:46.679 line:85%
Whoo-hoo-hoo-hoo, okay yeah.

00:07:46.679 --> 00:07:48.744 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yes.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>No, I'm good. I'm good.</c>

00:07:50.112 --> 00:07:51.188 line:85%
<c.cyan>Alright, so...</c>

00:07:51.188 --> 00:07:53.745 line:85%
And that is through and warm.

00:07:54.285 --> 00:07:56.114 line:85%
<i>(laughs triumphantly)</i>

00:07:56.114 --> 00:07:57.917 line:91%
<c.cyan>Woo!</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Thank you Elise!</c>

00:07:57.917 --> 00:08:00.977 line:85%
<i>(grunts)</i><c.colorEEEEEE> Yeah, I'm good.</c>

00:08:00.977 --> 00:08:05.148 line:91%
Last time, I was sat here
for a long time, recovering.

00:08:05.148 --> 00:08:08.714 line:91%
And I'm fine. I'm absolutely fine.
<c.cyan><i>(laughs  )</i>Yeah, you are!</c>

00:08:10.070 --> 00:08:12.173 line:91%
So...
<c.cyan>Well done.</c>

00:08:12.173 --> 00:08:14.216 line:91%
Last time, there was
a lot of stuff through there...

00:08:14.216 --> 00:08:15.529 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>...that I didn't get to see.</c>

00:08:15.529 --> 00:08:17.890 line:91%
There's one more wet bit, right?
<c.cyan>Yes, there is.</c>

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:20.209 position:56% line:91%
And the safety team were like,
"No, you're not going through that."

00:08:20.209 --> 00:08:22.602 position:73% line:91%
And I was like, "I'm not getting through that."
<c.cyan>I'm glad they made that call.</c>

00:08:22.602 --> 00:08:24.921 position:69% line:91%
No, it's the entirely right call, but I'm...
<c.cyan>It's a little bit higher.</c>

00:08:24.921 --> 00:08:25.908 line:91%
Yeah.
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>

00:08:25.908 --> 00:08:29.171 line:91%
So the next one is higher?
<c.cyan>Just a little bit. Not too much.</c>

00:08:29.171 --> 00:08:30.973 line:91%
It's fine. I'm...
<c.cyan>Not too much to worry about.</c>

00:08:30.973 --> 00:08:33.225 line:91%
I'm fine. I've even
got the microphone wet.

00:08:33.225 --> 00:08:34.567 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(group laughing)</i></c>

00:08:35.583 --> 00:08:37.071 line:85%
I'm excited— Hang on, hold on.

00:08:37.071 --> 00:08:39.580 line:91%
I'm excited... and I'm going fast.
<c.cyan>Yeah?</c>

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:42.000 position:56% line:91%
And every single time
I've had a proper injury in my life,

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:44.657 line:91%
like that scar on my face,
it's because...

00:08:44.657 --> 00:08:47.398 position:56% line:91%
I was in this mood, and it was like,
"Yeah, let's go, let's go!"

00:08:47.398 --> 00:08:49.689 position:59% line:91%
<c.cyan>Oh, okay. Yeah, yeah.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>So keep me in check, keep me in check.</c>

00:08:50.189 --> 00:08:51.925 line:85%
Yeah, I'm good. Let's go, let's go.

00:08:51.925 --> 00:08:52.997 line:85%
<c.cyan>Alright, let's go.</c>

00:08:52.997 --> 00:08:55.102 line:85%
I reckon this is as far as I got,

00:08:55.102 --> 00:08:57.862 position:58% line:91%
'cause I got through the two wet bits
just with the freakout,

00:08:57.862 --> 00:09:03.259 position:61% line:91%
and I remember clambering through this,
and then sort of left you behind at...

00:09:03.259 --> 00:09:05.214 line:91%
<c.cyan>This point here, roughly.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Yeah, this point here,</c>

00:09:05.214 --> 00:09:08.408 line:85%
before the very, very... <i>(chuckles)</i>

00:09:08.408 --> 00:09:10.342 line:85%
the bit with even less headroom.

00:09:10.342 --> 00:09:13.877 line:91%
I'll tell you what, though.
The wet suit does mean...

00:09:13.877 --> 00:09:16.816 line:91%
...I'm not nearly
as nimble as before.

00:09:16.816 --> 00:09:21.209 position:61% line:91%
I haven't got quite as much... <i>(grunts)</i>
...range of movement there, but...

00:09:22.121 --> 00:09:23.295 line:85%
Okay.

00:09:23.295 --> 00:09:25.563 line:85%
The next bit is...

00:09:25.563 --> 00:09:28.357 line:91%
...like that, but less headroom.
<c.cyan>Yes.</c>

00:09:28.357 --> 00:09:30.120 line:91%
<c.cyan>Less what?</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Less headroom.</c>

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:33.079 position:66% line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah, so bit less headroom,
which means you'll bend down a little bit,</c>

00:09:33.079 --> 00:09:35.851 line:91%
<c.cyan>meaning the water will come up
