00:09:35.851 --> 00:09:37.860 line:91%
Yeah, that's okay. It's not—
<c.cyan>We've been through this.</c>

00:09:37.860 --> 00:09:40.698 line:91%
Neck and head's up. Neck and head's
above water. I'll be fine.

00:09:40.698 --> 00:09:42.104 line:85%
<c.cyan>Yeah, brilliant.</c>

00:09:42.104 --> 00:09:45.350 line:91%
I say I'll be fine. This is
uncharted territory for me now.

00:09:46.203 --> 00:09:49.079 line:91%
I'm starting to make
grumbling noises as I move.

00:09:49.579 --> 00:09:52.751 position:58% line:85%
<c.cyan>Tom is getting on fantastically well.</c>

00:09:52.751 --> 00:09:55.017 line:85%
<c.cyan>I'm so happy.</c>

00:09:55.017 --> 00:09:58.328 line:91%
<c.cyan>I'm just— I'm so happy
he even decided to come back,</c>

00:09:58.328 --> 00:10:00.929 line:91%
<c.cyan>face his fears,
and get through it all.</c>

00:10:01.429 --> 00:10:06.413 position:59% line:91%
You may notice, viewers, that the crew
have moved our microphones.

00:10:08.105 --> 00:10:11.594 line:91%
Right like, Britney mics
on the side of our faces.

00:10:11.594 --> 00:10:13.705 position:63% line:85%
And I know that looks ridiculous, but...

00:10:14.584 --> 00:10:18.333 line:85%
<i>(grunts)</i><c.colorEEEEEE> This is... very...</c>

00:10:18.333 --> 00:10:22.152 line:85%
<i>(groans)</i><c.colorEEEEEE> very... low headroom.</c>

00:10:22.152 --> 00:10:23.490 line:85%
Here we go, okay.

00:10:23.490 --> 00:10:25.581 line:91%
<c.cyan>So I'd put my back
against the wall, Tom.</c>

00:10:25.581 --> 00:10:27.683 line:91%
I'm just gonna use the neoprene.
<c.cyan>Yeah?</c>

00:10:27.683 --> 00:10:31.040 position:73% line:91%
I think I'm gonna just float through like this,
and I'm gonna be fine.

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:34.769 line:91%
I would be having a bad time
if it weren't for the wetsuit!

00:10:34.769 --> 00:10:36.399 line:91%
<i>(laughing)</i>
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(water splashing)</i></c>

00:10:36.399 --> 00:10:38.857 line:91%
Oh, I'm glad I didn't
come through here last time.

00:10:38.857 --> 00:10:41.610 line:91%
That would've—
That would've been a very bad time.

00:10:42.481 --> 00:10:45.867 line:91%
<c.yellow>So congratulations, Tom.</c>
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(crew cheering and applauding)</i></c>

00:10:45.867 --> 00:10:47.829 line:85%
Now that feels patronising!

00:10:47.829 --> 00:10:49.765 line:91%
<c.cyan><i>(laughs)</i></c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>That does feel patronising!</c>

00:10:49.765 --> 00:10:51.273 line:91%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(crew chattering)</i></c>
<i>(chuckles)</i>

00:10:51.273 --> 00:10:53.801 line:91%
<i>(laughs)</i>
<c.cyan>Right.</c>

00:10:53.801 --> 00:10:55.734 line:85%
I made it through!

00:10:55.734 --> 00:10:57.505 line:91%
<c.cyan>Not bad.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Agh!</c>

00:10:57.505 --> 00:10:59.538 position:56% line:91%
You know what I shouldn't have done?
Raised my hands above my head,

00:10:59.538 --> 00:11:01.768 line:91%
I put a load of cold water
down my back!

00:11:01.768 --> 00:11:05.329 line:91%
Last time, you got to somewhere
that looked beautiful.

00:11:05.329 --> 00:11:07.617 line:91%
And you said "Wish you were here."
<c.cyan>Mhm.</c>

00:11:07.617 --> 00:11:08.889 line:91%
Let's get there.
<c.cyan>Let's get there.</c>

00:11:08.889 --> 00:11:11.177 line:85%
<c.cyan>Tom, can you see on the left here?</c>

00:11:11.703 --> 00:11:14.349 line:91%
The line?
<c.cyan>We've got a straight line,</c>

00:11:14.349 --> 00:11:16.491 line:85%
<c.cyan>almost exactly straight here.</c>

00:11:16.491 --> 00:11:20.437 line:91%
<c.cyan>This is actually foam,
and it's a flood indicator.</c>

00:11:20.437 --> 00:11:22.111 line:91%
<c.cyan>So, in the— Yeah!</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>...Oh wow.</c>

00:11:22.111 --> 00:11:24.194 line:91%
<c.cyan>In the past couple of weeks,
we've had a few storms,</c>

00:11:24.194 --> 00:11:26.196 line:85%
<c.cyan>like Storm Eunice for example.</c>

00:11:26.196 --> 00:11:29.739 position:63% line:91%
<c.cyan>And what's happened is that
the water has come up to this line here.</c>

00:11:29.739 --> 00:11:32.102 line:91%
But this is metres up from
where we were down there.

00:11:32.102 --> 00:11:32.929 line:91%
That's—
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>

00:11:32.929 --> 00:11:34.876 line:91%
Why does that sound hollow?
It isn't.

00:11:34.876 --> 00:11:37.546 line:91%
<c.cyan>This is all silt.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>It's the echo in here.</c>

00:11:37.546 --> 00:11:39.935 line:91%
It's familiar, it's like,
"There's a hole under there."

00:11:39.935 --> 00:11:40.731 line:85%
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>

00:11:41.007 --> 00:11:42.184 line:91%
Wow.
<c.cyan>Fantastic.</c>

00:11:42.184 --> 00:11:45.323 line:91%
So is there— I'm assuming there's
solid rock somewhere back here.

00:11:45.323 --> 00:11:47.688 position:70% line:91%
<c.cyan>Oh yeah.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>It's just covered in a massive layer of silt.</c>

00:11:47.688 --> 00:11:50.439 position:56% line:91%
<c.cyan>I mean, if you look up a bit higher,
you can see the rock.</c>

00:11:50.439 --> 00:11:51.838 line:91%
Oh yeah.
<c.cyan>Yeah? So that's where</c>

00:11:51.838 --> 00:11:54.145 line:91%
<c.cyan>the water hasn't really come up,
past that point there.</c>

00:11:54.145 --> 00:11:55.662 line:91%
Right.
<c.cyan>But yeah.</c>

00:11:55.662 --> 00:11:57.095 line:85%
<c.cyan>Fantastic, isn't it?</c>

00:11:57.680 --> 00:11:59.295 line:85%
I'm so glad I got through here.

00:11:59.295 --> 00:12:00.842 line:91%
<c.cyan><i>(laughs)</i></c>
<i>(chuckles)</i>

00:12:00.842 --> 00:12:03.749 line:91%
I'm just glad I'm not
crouched in water anymore.

00:12:03.749 --> 00:12:04.551 line:85%
<c.cyan><i>(laughs)</i></c>

00:12:04.551 --> 00:12:06.737 line:91%
So is it— It's onwards,
through the tube, and...?

00:12:06.737 --> 00:12:08.911 line:91%
<c.cyan>Oh, through the tube.
Yeah, let's go.</c>

00:12:09.411 --> 00:12:10.864 line:85%
<i>(breathing heavily)</i>

00:12:10.864 --> 00:12:13.003 line:85%
So how long does this go for?

00:12:13.003 --> 00:12:18.001 line:91%
<c.cyan>Oh, this is probably a ten-minute
