00:12:18.001 --> 00:12:19.295 line:91%
Alright.
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>

00:12:19.295 --> 00:12:21.897 position:69% line:91%
<c.cyan>But the thing is that it's full of boulders,
as you can see here.</c>

00:12:21.897 --> 00:12:24.001 line:91%
Yeah.
<c.cyan>So it's— </c><c.colorCCCCCC><i>(both chuckling)</i></c>

00:12:24.636 --> 00:12:26.701 line:91%
Last time, I was sat
for an hour that way.

00:12:26.701 --> 00:12:27.623 line:91%
<c.cyan>Mm.</c>
<i>(chuckles)</i>

00:12:27.623 --> 00:12:29.472 line:85%
<i>(grunting)</i>

00:12:29.472 --> 00:12:30.758 line:85%
<i>(cackles)</i>

00:12:30.758 --> 00:12:32.362 line:91%
No, I'm fine.
<c.cyan>Okay.</c>

00:12:32.362 --> 00:12:35.602 position:61% line:91%
It's just literally 30 seconds earlier,
you said, "Mind your head."

00:12:35.602 --> 00:12:37.054 line:85%
<i>(chuckles)</i>

00:12:37.054 --> 00:12:39.365 line:91%
Whacked my head
into the roof, didn't I?

00:12:39.365 --> 00:12:40.704 line:85%
It's why we've got the helmets.

00:12:40.704 --> 00:12:44.636 line:85%
<c.cyan>So, remember how limestone is...</c>

00:12:44.636 --> 00:12:46.227 line:85%
Oh wow! <i>(laughs)</i>

00:12:46.227 --> 00:12:48.474 line:85%
I don't think I've ever seen...

00:12:48.474 --> 00:12:51.549 position:70% line:91%
I must've seen something like this somewhere,
but never close up, and never like this.

00:12:51.549 --> 00:12:52.856 line:91%
<c.cyan>Mm.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>They all...</c>

00:12:52.856 --> 00:12:55.610 position:78% line:91%
They've all got drips on the end of them,
because of course they have, that's what they are.

00:12:55.610 --> 00:13:00.400 position:75% line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah, so the water is carrying
the element that's actually creating them there.</c>

00:13:00.400 --> 00:13:02.889 line:85%
These are natural stalactites.

00:13:02.889 --> 00:13:06.217 line:91%
<c.cyan>All from that calcium carbonite
in the shells.</c>

00:13:06.217 --> 00:13:08.711 line:91%
Oh, I'm so glad I got through here.
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(both chuckling)</i></c>

00:13:09.575 --> 00:13:11.585 line:91%
<c.cyan>Incredible, isn't it? Yeah.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Wow...</c>

00:13:14.263 --> 00:13:16.430 line:91%
Ah, thank you, Elise.
<c.cyan>That's alright!</c>

00:13:16.430 --> 00:13:18.759 position:63% line:85%
I mean, there's still more to go, but...

00:13:18.759 --> 00:13:19.820 line:85%
<i>(grunts)</i>

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:22.174 line:91%
<c.yellow>So what we're gonna do
is just hop over</c>

00:13:22.174 --> 00:13:24.001 line:91%
<c.yellow>the shallow bit of the cavern
in a minute.</c>

00:13:24.001 --> 00:13:26.023 line:91%
<c.yellow>And then we're gonna slide
down into the tunnel a bit.</c>

00:13:26.023 --> 00:13:30.390 position:67% line:91%
<c.yellow>It's all very spacious, it's just kind of a
sideways shuffle down, like crab-walking.</c>

00:13:30.390 --> 00:13:33.068 position:63% line:91%
<c.yellow>If it ever gets tight around your chest,
you can just duck down,</c>

00:13:33.068 --> 00:13:36.390 position:64% line:91%
<c.yellow>'cause it's wide around your feet,
so you might just crawl a couple of feet,</c>

00:13:36.390 --> 00:13:38.330 line:91%
<c.yellow>and then just stand up again,
see how you get on.</c>

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:41.494 line:91%
<c.cyan>So this is the kind of—</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Oh, that is a long way down, okay.</c>

00:13:41.494 --> 00:13:45.262 position:69% line:91%
<c.cyan>That's a little bit of a leap of faith here.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>That's a good 2-3 metres, alright.</c>

00:13:45.262 --> 00:13:48.164 line:91%
<c.cyan>Trust your boots.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Yeah. It's got a little bridge.</c>

00:13:48.164 --> 00:13:50.677 position:64% line:91%
I don't trust the bridge for some reason.
<c.cyan><i>(laughs)</i></c>

00:13:51.280 --> 00:13:53.624 line:91%
<c.cyan>I think I've used it before,
so it's fine.</c>

00:13:53.624 --> 00:13:56.622 line:91%
<c.cyan>Then when you get here,
just sit on your butt like this.</c>

00:13:56.622 --> 00:13:59.466 line:91%
<c.cyan>And the objective is to slide
