00:14:00.001 --> 00:14:02.041 line:91%
Oh, it's a waterfall!
<c.cyan><i>(laughs)</i></c>

00:14:02.041 --> 00:14:05.198 line:91%
Right, it's the worst water slide
I've ever been on, got it.

00:14:05.198 --> 00:14:06.587 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(crew laughing)</i></c>

00:14:06.587 --> 00:14:09.144 line:91%
<c.green>I'm just gonna grab your belt.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Yep. Thank you very much.</c>

00:14:09.144 --> 00:14:10.500 line:85%
So one hand there...

00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:12.969 line:91%
<c.green>Yeah, onto that rock.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Onto that rock.</c>

00:14:12.969 --> 00:14:15.716 position:58% line:91%
I think I just bopped you in the nose
with my elbow. Sorry about that.

00:14:15.716 --> 00:14:16.973 line:85%
<c.yellow>Ah, it's okay.</c>

00:14:16.973 --> 00:14:18.440 line:85%
<i>(laughs)</i>

00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:20.136 line:85%
Not sure that's better!

00:14:21.391 --> 00:14:22.305 line:85%
<i>(groans)</i>

00:14:22.305 --> 00:14:24.187 line:85%
<c.cyan>So this is a vadose trench.</c>

00:14:24.187 --> 00:14:26.509 line:91%
A what?
<c.cyan>A vadose trench.</c>

00:14:26.509 --> 00:14:27.522 line:85%
Right, okay.

00:14:27.522 --> 00:14:29.599 line:91%
<c.cyan>So it's again,
the water over the years</c>

00:14:29.599 --> 00:14:31.610 line:91%
<c.cyan>has gone down and down
