00:14:34.515 --> 00:14:36.276 line:91%
You could—
<c.cyan>Very tight place.</c>

00:14:36.276 --> 00:14:38.545 position:58% line:91%
I'm already sideways.
You're walking forwards through that.

00:14:38.545 --> 00:14:40.750 line:85%
I'm already— Yeah, okay.

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:43.662 line:91%
<c.cyan>Alright, so we can approach this
