00:14:48.865 --> 00:14:50.862 line:91%
<c.cyan>you could dip down...</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>You can just duck, alright.</c>

00:14:50.862 --> 00:14:53.419 line:91%
<c.cyan>...and duck through it instead.
That's up to you what you do.</c>

00:14:53.419 --> 00:14:55.629 line:91%
Yeah, I think when I look at that,
I can get through standing.

00:14:55.629 --> 00:14:56.569 line:85%
<c.cyan>Yeah?</c>

00:14:56.569 --> 00:14:59.162 line:91%
If I duck down, I think
we're gonna have a worse time.

00:14:59.162 --> 00:15:00.539 line:91%
<c.cyan>Brilliant.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Oh.</c>

00:15:00.539 --> 00:15:02.526 line:91%
Last time, I didn't understand
why you like caving.

00:15:02.526 --> 00:15:04.382 line:85%
Now I do. I get this now.

00:15:04.382 --> 00:15:05.780 line:85%
Now I'm not— <i>(laughs)</i>

00:15:05.780 --> 00:15:07.898 line:91%
Now I'm not constantly
freezing cold and grumpy!

00:15:07.898 --> 00:15:09.701 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah, yeah.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>I get this now.</c>

00:15:09.701 --> 00:15:11.798 line:91%
<c.cyan>I'm glad you like it!</c>
<i>(chuckles)</i>

00:15:12.339 --> 00:15:14.195 line:91%
<c.cyan>Alright, so...</c>
<i>(sighs)</i>

00:15:14.195 --> 00:15:16.922 line:91%
<c.cyan>We're coming to something
