00:15:22.719 --> 00:15:23.481 line:85%
Right.

00:15:23.481 --> 00:15:26.075 line:91%
<c.cyan>So these bits here are
always on the wall,</c>

00:15:26.075 --> 00:15:28.471 line:91%
<c.cyan>and we've tested them
