00:15:28.471 --> 00:15:30.747 line:91%
So over years, this has
just been rigged together,

00:15:30.747 --> 00:15:32.518 line:91%
like people bringing the gear
down to make it?

00:15:32.518 --> 00:15:33.775 line:91%
<c.cyan>Absolutely.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Wow, okay.</c>

00:15:33.775 --> 00:15:36.206 line:91%
<c.cyan>Including a ladder
that we're about to go down.</c>

00:15:36.206 --> 00:15:39.018 line:91%
<c.cyan>So somebody would've gone
through the whole cave</c>

00:15:39.018 --> 00:15:42.001 line:91%
<c.cyan>handling a ladder all the way
