00:15:42.001 --> 00:15:43.855 line:91%
Wow.
<c.cyan>To screw it onto the wall.</c>

00:15:43.855 --> 00:15:44.598 line:85%
Alright!

00:15:44.598 --> 00:15:47.598 align:start size:97% position:3% line:7%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(water cascading)</i></c>

00:15:45.783 --> 00:15:48.287 position:56% line:91%
Whoa. Got caught on something there.
There we go, alright.

00:15:49.046 --> 00:15:50.437 line:85%
Around and back.

00:15:52.059 --> 00:15:54.347 line:91%
Oh bloody hell!
There's a gap there, isn't there?

00:15:54.964 --> 00:15:56.578 line:85%
Woo-hoo-hoo, okay!

00:15:56.578 --> 00:15:58.457 line:85%
That's— Yeah, that is—

00:15:58.457 --> 00:16:00.148 position:58% line:85%
I see why they call it Surprise View!

00:16:00.148 --> 00:16:01.884 line:85%
Right, okay. Here we go.

00:16:01.884 --> 00:16:04.384 align:start size:97% position:3% line:7%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(water dripping)</i></c>

00:16:13.126 --> 00:16:14.274 line:85%
Clear!

00:16:14.449 --> 00:16:15.807 line:85%
<c.green><i>(distant shouting)</i></c>

00:16:18.381 --> 00:16:20.046 line:91%
<i>(laughs)</i>
<c.cyan><i>(giggles)</i></c>

00:16:20.046 --> 00:16:22.408 line:91%
<c.cyan>This is the area now, Tom...</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Yeah.</c>

00:16:22.408 --> 00:16:25.054 line:85%
<c.cyan>...where I really wanted you to be.</c>

00:16:25.054 --> 00:16:26.424 line:91%
Oh, is this the
