00:16:29.323 --> 00:16:32.644 position:73% line:91%
<c.cyan>And now you are here.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>This is the endpoint. This is where you got to.</c>

00:16:32.644 --> 00:16:34.976 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yes, this is the endpoint.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>This was— So I—</c>

00:16:34.976 --> 00:16:36.000 line:85%
<i>(cackles)</i>

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:38.652 line:91%
I was about to say,
I can get in the water.

00:16:38.652 --> 00:16:40.744 line:91%
